# ── Toolkit output folders, if a job is ever run from the repo root ───────────
# The documented Quick Start launches from here, so a job pointed at the repo
# would dump output alongside the source. Root-anchored on purpose: these names
# are ordinary elsewhere, and testing/ fixtures are covered above.
# See docs/adr/0001-single-web-ui-adapter.md and _prepared_folder() in
# utils/tool_registry.py, which refuses an unprepared start.
/cropped/
/straightened/
/bordered/
/merged/
/extracted-pages/
/PDFs/
/errored-files/

# ── OS / editor artifacts ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.idea/
.vscode/
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

# ── Claude Code internal ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
**/.claude/
